 {"title":"Welcome and prayer","part":"Pre-call","position":0,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","offset":0,"planned_minutes":10,"state":"ready","prompt":"We are only God’s servants through whom you believed the Good News. Each of us did the work the Lord gave us. I planted the seed in your hearts, and Apollos watered it, but it was God who made it grow. It’s not important who does the planting, or who does the watering. **What’s important is that God makes the seed grow.** The one who plants and the one who waters work together with the same purpose.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The Process","options":{"screen":"scripture","reference":"1 Corinthians 3:5-8","translation":"New Living Translation","size":"body"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":true},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Share the TV view in the call, not this screen. Put the passage up with the join link along the edge, pray, then give the link a minute. People sign in on their phones and stay signed in for the retreat. Open the call in prayer, then move on."},
 {"title":"Celebrations: one word","part":"Pre-call","position":1,"mode":"live","interaction":"word_cloud","planned_minutes":7,"state":"ready","prompt":"In one word, what is God doing among us that is worth celebrating?","phone_depth":"","segment":"Celebrations","lands_in":"The Process","options":{},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"key":"precall_celebration","notes":"Let the cloud fill for a minute. Ask about the biggest words first, then the small ones that surprise you. Celebrations begin live in this call. There is no pre-work."},
 {"title":"Celebrations: a sentence","part":"Pre-call","position":2,"mode":"live","interaction":"wall","planned_minutes":8,"state":"ready","prompt":"What is God doing among us that is worth celebrating?","phone_depth":"","segment":"Celebrations","lands_in":"The Process","options":{},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"notes":"One or two sentences each. Read a few aloud and ask who else saw it. These stay as the Celebrations in the report."},
 {"title":"Metrics","part":"Pre-call","position":3,"mode":"live","interaction":"ranking","planned_minutes":15,"state":"draft","prompt":"Rank the measures that would tell us we are making progress.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The 3-year Vision","options":{"items":[{"key":"o1","text":"People growing as disciples"},{"key":"o2","text":"People serving on a team"},{"key":"o3","text":"Small group participation"},{"key":"o4","text":"Weekly worship attendance"},{"key":"o5","text":"Giving"},{"key":"o6","text":"New people connected"}],"suggest":true},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Before the call, replace these starter measures with the ones that fit this church. Turn any Discover input about success measures into options in setup. The room can suggest more during the call (Add an option). Look at the top of the ranking and ask what the order tells us."},
 {"title":"What we heard: Survey","part":"Pre-call","position":4,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":4,"state":"draft","prompt":"","phone_depth":"The detail under this headline.","segment":"What we heard","lands_in":"What We Heard","options":{"screen":"headline","source":"Congregational survey"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Type the headline for survey by hand from the Discover results: one number and one line, and flag thin data on the line. Put the detail on phones with phone depth. Until the Discover reader is built, this stays typed by hand."},
