 {"title":"Five Lenses: {lens name}","part":"Day 1","position":3,"mode":"live","interaction":"lens","planned_minutes":55,"state":"ready","prompt":"It's {base year + 10}. Describe our {lens name}.","phone_depth":"Write in the present tense, as if it is already true. One sentence at a time.","segment":"Five Lenses","lands_in":"The 10-year Future","options":{"lens":1,"ai":true},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":5,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":10,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"seeded_from":"seeding","notes":"Set the scene. The seeded sentences appear first, so the room starts with everyone's view. Give 3 to 5 minutes to write, then phones down. Draw out the conversation from the wall and build on the easel. The scribe tags quotes, decisions and tensions and photographs the easel page. Similar sentences lean together into clusters while people write."},
