 {"title":"What are we sensing?","part":"Day 2","position":2,"mode":"live","interaction":"wall","planned_minutes":15,"state":"ready","prompt":"What are we sensing?","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The Process","options":{},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"notes":"One prompt. Let what the team shares land on the wall, and read a few aloud. The scribe notes what the team shares."},
 {"title":"Confirm the 10-year Future","part":"Day 2","position":3,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":30,"state":"ready","prompt":"Our {base year + 10} Future","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The 10-year Future","options":{"screen":"holding","outline":"Each signed-off lens, in turn\nWhat has changed overnight?\nSay it out loud"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"A short confirm after prayer. Read each signed-off lens in turn and ask whether anything has changed overnight. The scribe records any change and its reason. This screen is a placeholder until the read-back is built in milestone 5."},
 {"title":"Confirm the Vision Outcomes","part":"Day 2","position":4,"mode":"live","interaction":"confirm","planned_minutes":30,"state":"ready","prompt":"Confirm, rename or challenge each outcome.","phone_depth":"Confirm, rename or challenge each outcome. A reason is optional.","segment":"","lands_in":"The 3-year Vision, Decisions","options":{},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"notes":"The TV shows the counts for confirm, rename and challenge. A challenged outcome lifts to the top of your list and gets a soft highlight on the TV until it is decided. Counts never decide: record the room's consensus decision and its reasons for each outcome. The app warns, and never blocks, if fewer than four or more than six are confirmed. Write a one-line description for each outcome. The scribe records the decision and why."},
 {"title":"Pre-mortem","part":"Day 2","position":5,"mode":"live","interaction":"grid","planned_minutes":30,"state":"ready","prompt":"It's {base year + 3} and this plan failed. Why?","phone_depth":"Name a reason the plan failed, then place it.","segment":"","lands_in":"Risks and Roadblocks","options":{"preset":"pre_mortem","x_label":"Likelihood","x_low":"Unlikely","x_high":"Likely","y_label":"Impact","y_low":"Low","y_high":"High","legend":"Reasons it failed","items":[]},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":120,"max_words":20,"team_led":false,"notes":"The 2x2 grid with the Pre-mortem preset. Each person names reasons the plan failed, then places them by likelihood and impact. AI merges duplicate reasons and you can undo any merge. Record the mitigations the team names from your control surface, next to each reason. The scribe can tag mitigations once the scribe console is open."},
 {"title":"Break","part":"Day 2","position":6,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":15,"state":"ready","prompt":"Back in 15 minutes.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"","options":{"screen":"holding"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Nothing live."},
 {"title":"1-year Outlook","part":"Day 2","position":7,"mode":"live","interaction":"goals","planned_minutes":90,"state":"ready","prompt":"What will we do in {base year + 1} to move each outcome forward?","phone_depth":"Propose a goal with a title, the result, one owner and an end date.","segment":"","lands_in":"The 1-year Outlook, CORE goals","options":{"risk_links":"required"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":6,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"notes":"One Vision Outcome at a time: its 3-year Vision bullets on the left and its 1-year goals on the right. A goal needs a title, a result, one owner and an end date, and answers a risk from the pre-mortem. Each CORE letter shows met or missing, checked in code, and a goal stays outlined until all four are met. Owners come from the attendee list or are added by name and email. The scribe notes decisions, owners and dates."},
 {"title":"Lunch","part":"Day 2","position":8,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":45,"state":"ready","prompt":"Lunch. Back in 45 minutes.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"","options":{"screen":"holding"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Nothing live."},
 {"title":"The team takes the remote","part":"Day 2","position":9,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":10,"state":"ready","prompt":"The team takes the remote","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"","options":{"screen":"holding"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":true,"notes":"Hand over the remote from your control surface. Name the team facilitator, who runs the next two sessions from their phone. You can take it back at any time without the TV changing, and it returns to you after the block. There is no scribe from here: the console is off while the team leads."},
 {"title":"Commander's intent","part":"Day 2","position":10,"mode":"live","interaction":"intent","planned_minutes":80,"state":"ready","prompt":"Write one card for each Vision Outcome.","phone_depth":"Work with your pair on your card. Everyone sees it fill in on the screen.","segment":"","lands_in":"Commander's Intent, CORE","options":{"assign":"remote"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":true,"notes":"Team led. The team facilitator pairs people with outcomes from the remote, or lets people pick on their phones. Each card has the commander's intent, the must-do, what we will stop and the next 30 days. A first step needs an owner and a date, and is outlined until it has both. Pairs then present, and edits made while presenting replace the old lines on the TV as they are typed."},
 {"title":"Affirm together","part":"Day 2","position":11,"mode":"live","interaction":"sign","planned_minutes":15,"state":"ready","prompt":"We affirm these cards.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"Commander's Intent","options":{},"settings":{"anonymous":false,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":true,"notes":"Team led. Read the full set of cards aloud, then invite everyone to sign. Names gather beneath the cards."},
 {"title":"Recap","part":"Day 2","position":12,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":25,"state":"ready","prompt":"Recap","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"Clearway Map","options":{"screen":"holding","line":"Our draft Clearway Map"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Open the draft Clearway Map from the live room (Draft Clearway Map) and walk through page 1, then page 2, with the team. It is built from the two days and shows what is empty as empty. This Year's Priorities is left empty for the church's Annual Planning. Print or save it as a PDF for the team. It is for your control surface and printing, not the TV."},
 {"title":"Closing prayer","part":"Day 2","position":13,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":10,"state":"ready","prompt":"Go in peace.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The Process","options":{"screen":"prayer"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Close by praying over the team, the outcomes and the work ahead."}
]$tpl$::jsonb) on conflict(id) do nothing;
insert into private.templates(id,name,description,kind,shared,sessions) values('c1ea0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003','Wayfinding, day and a half',
 'The day-and-a-half Wayfinding retreat: the pre-call, Day 1 and a half day, with the pre-mortem and commander''s intent in a video follow-up led by the team''s own facilitator through a follow-up link and code. Pick the pre-call start. Day 1 is set 14 days later at 9:00, the half day the next morning at 8:30 and the follow-up a week after that at 10:00; change a part''s start in the run of show.','shipped',true,$tpl$[
 {"title":"Welcome and prayer","part":"Pre-call","position":0,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","offset":0,"planned_minutes":10,"state":"ready","prompt":"We are only God’s servants through whom you believed the Good News. Each of us did the work the Lord gave us. I planted the seed in your hearts, and Apollos watered it, but it was God who made it grow. It’s not important who does the planting, or who does the watering. **What’s important is that God makes the seed grow.** The one who plants and the one who waters work together with the same purpose.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The Process","options":{"screen":"scripture","reference":"1 Corinthians 3:5-8","translation":"New Living Translation","size":"body"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":true},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Share the TV view in the call, not this screen. Put the passage up with the join link along the edge, pray, then give the link a minute. People sign in on their phones and stay signed in for the retreat. Open the call in prayer, then move on."},
 {"title":"Celebrations: one word","part":"Pre-call","position":1,"mode":"live","interaction":"word_cloud","planned_minutes":7,"state":"ready","prompt":"In one word, what is God doing among us that is worth celebrating?","phone_depth":"","segment":"Celebrations","lands_in":"The Process","options":{},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"key":"precall_celebration","notes":"Let the cloud fill for a minute. Ask about the biggest words first, then the small ones that surprise you. Celebrations begin live in this call. There is no pre-work."},
 {"title":"Celebrations: a sentence","part":"Pre-call","position":2,"mode":"live","interaction":"wall","planned_minutes":8,"state":"ready","prompt":"What is God doing among us that is worth celebrating?","phone_depth":"","segment":"Celebrations","lands_in":"The Process","options":{},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"notes":"One or two sentences each. Read a few aloud and ask who else saw it. These stay as the Celebrations in the report."},
 {"title":"Metrics","part":"Pre-call","position":3,"mode":"live","interaction":"ranking","planned_minutes":15,"state":"draft","prompt":"Rank the measures that would tell us we are making progress.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The 3-year Vision","options":{"items":[{"key":"o1","text":"People growing as disciples"},{"key":"o2","text":"People serving on a team"},{"key":"o3","text":"Small group participation"},{"key":"o4","text":"Weekly worship attendance"},{"key":"o5","text":"Giving"},{"key":"o6","text":"New people connected"}],"suggest":true},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Before the call, replace these starter measures with the ones that fit this church. Turn any Discover input about success measures into options in setup. The room can suggest more during the call (Add an option). Look at the top of the ranking and ask what the order tells us."},
 {"title":"What we heard: Survey","part":"Pre-call","position":4,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":4,"state":"draft","prompt":"","phone_depth":"The detail under this headline.","segment":"What we heard","lands_in":"What We Heard","options":{"screen":"headline","source":"Congregational survey"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Type the headline for survey by hand from the Discover results: one number and one line, and flag thin data on the line. Put the detail on phones with phone depth. Until the Discover reader is built, this stays typed by hand."},
 {"title":"What we heard: Four Helpful Lists","part":"Pre-call","position":5,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":4,"state":"draft","prompt":"","phone_depth":"The detail under this headline.","segment":"What we heard","lands_in":"What We Heard","options":{"screen":"headline","source":"Four Helpful Lists"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Type the headline for four helpful lists by hand from the Discover results: one number and one line, and flag thin data on the line. Put the detail on phones with phone depth. Until the Discover reader is built, this stays typed by hand."},
 {"title":"What we heard: Board and staff input","part":"Pre-call","position":6,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":4,"state":"draft","prompt":"","phone_depth":"The detail under this headline.","segment":"What we heard","lands_in":"What We Heard","options":{"screen":"headline","source":"Board and staff input conversations"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Type the headline for board and staff input by hand from the Discover results: one number and one line, and flag thin data on the line. Put the detail on phones with phone depth. Until the Discover reader is built, this stays typed by hand."},
 {"title":"What we heard: Leadership interviews","part":"Pre-call","position":7,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":4,"state":"draft","prompt":"","phone_depth":"The detail under this headline.","segment":"What we heard","lands_in":"Leadership Interviews","options":{"screen":"headline","source":"Leadership interviews"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Type the headline for leadership interviews by hand from the Discover results: one number and one line, and flag thin data on the line. Put the detail on phones with phone depth. Until the Discover reader is built, this stays typed by hand."},
 {"title":"Questions","part":"Pre-call","position":8,"mode":"live","interaction":"qa","planned_minutes":14,"state":"ready","prompt":"What questions do you have about what you just heard?","phone_depth":"","segment":"What we heard","lands_in":"What We Heard","options":{"any_time":false},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":10,"max_characters":200,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"notes":"Anonymous questions that fold and rise by votes. Answer the top ones, mark each Answered, and take the rest into the retreat."},
 {"title":"Seed the Five Lenses","part":"Pre-call","position":9,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":20,"state":"ready","prompt":"It's {base year + 10}. Start writing what is true.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The 10-year Future","options":{"screen":"holding","outline":"Pick a lens on your phone\nWrite in the present tense\nOne sentence at a time\nHidden until each lens opens"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":true},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"key":"seed_intro","notes":"Explain the Five Lenses and how the retreat will use them: each describes the 10-year Future in the present tense, as if it is already true. Everyone starts writing now. The sentences stay hidden from everyone, including you, until each lens opens on Day 1. You only see how many have been written. Seeding stays open on phones until Day 1."},
 {"title":"Seeding the Five Lenses","part":"Pre-call","position":10,"mode":"self_paced","interaction":"lens","opens":70,"closes_day":14,"closes_clock":"09:00","planned_minutes":5,"state":"ready","prompt":"It's {base year + 10}. Describe our future, one lens at a time.","phone_depth":"Pick a lens, then write in the present tense, as if it is already true. Your sentences stay hidden until that lens opens on Day 1.","segment":"","lands_in":"The 10-year Future","options":{"seed":true},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":25,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"key":"seeding","notes":"Self-paced. It opens when the Seed the Five Lenses screen goes up and stays open until Day 1 begins. Closing the pre-call does not close it. Add the call recording link here for anyone who missed the call, in the step's options. You see only how many sentences each lens has."},
 {"title":"Welcome","part":"Day 1","position":0,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","day":14,"clock":"09:00","planned_minutes":5,"state":"ready","prompt":"","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The Process","options":{"screen":"holding"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":true},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Put this up as people arrive. The join screen shows names arriving. Ask everyone to join on their phone with the room link. The scribe notes who is in the room."},
 {"title":"Opening prayer","part":"Day 1","position":1,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":10,"state":"ready","prompt":"Let's begin in prayer.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The Process","options":{"screen":"prayer"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Pray for the team and for the two days ahead. Invite someone on the team to pray if that fits the room."},
 {"title":"Celebration, short","part":"Day 1","position":2,"mode":"live","interaction":"word_cloud","planned_minutes":20,"state":"ready","prompt":"In one word, what is worth celebrating?","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The Process","options":{},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"seeded_from":"precall_celebration","notes":"Start from the pre-call celebrations and add to them. About 20 minutes. Ask about the biggest words and the surprising small ones. The scribe keeps quotes worth keeping."},
 {"title":"Five Lenses: {lens name}","part":"Day 1","position":3,"mode":"live","interaction":"lens","planned_minutes":55,"state":"ready","prompt":"It's {base year + 10}. Describe our {lens name}.","phone_depth":"Write in the present tense, as if it is already true. One sentence at a time.","segment":"Five Lenses","lands_in":"The 10-year Future","options":{"lens":1,"ai":true},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":5,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":10,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"seeded_from":"seeding","notes":"Set the scene. The seeded sentences appear first, so the room starts with everyone's view. Give 3 to 5 minutes to write, then phones down. Draw out the conversation from the wall and build on the easel. The scribe tags quotes, decisions and tensions and photographs the easel page. Similar sentences lean together into clusters while people write."},
 {"title":"Break","part":"Day 1","position":4,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":15,"state":"ready","prompt":"Back in 15 minutes.","phone_depth":"","segment":"Five Lenses","lands_in":"","options":{"screen":"holding"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Nothing live. Phones can still add to the lens you just left."},
 {"title":"Five Lenses: {lens name}","part":"Day 1","position":5,"mode":"live","interaction":"lens","planned_minutes":60,"state":"ready","prompt":"It's {base year + 10}. Describe our {lens name}.","phone_depth":"Write in the present tense, as if it is already true. One sentence at a time.","segment":"Five Lenses","lands_in":"The 10-year Future","options":{"lens":2,"ai":true},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":5,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":10,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"seeded_from":"seeding","notes":"Set the scene. The seeded sentences appear first, so the room starts with everyone's view. Give 3 to 5 minutes to write, then phones down. Draw out the conversation from the wall and build on the easel. The scribe tags quotes, decisions and tensions and photographs the easel page. Similar sentences lean together into clusters while people write."},
 {"title":"Lunch","part":"Day 1","position":6,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":45,"state":"ready","prompt":"Lunch. Back in 45 minutes.","phone_depth":"","segment":"Five Lenses","lands_in":"","options":{"screen":"holding"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Nothing live."},
 {"title":"Five Lenses: {lens name}","part":"Day 1","position":7,"mode":"live","interaction":"lens","planned_minutes":40,"state":"ready","prompt":"It's {base year + 10}. Describe our {lens name}.","phone_depth":"Write in the present tense, as if it is already true. One sentence at a time.","segment":"Five Lenses","lands_in":"The 10-year Future","options":{"lens":3,"ai":true},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":5,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":10,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"seeded_from":"seeding","notes":"Set the scene. The seeded sentences appear first, so the room starts with everyone's view. Give 3 to 5 minutes to write, then phones down. Draw out the conversation from the wall and build on the easel. The scribe tags quotes, decisions and tensions and photographs the easel page. Similar sentences lean together into clusters while people write."},
 {"title":"Five Lenses: {lens name}","part":"Day 1","position":8,"mode":"live","interaction":"lens","planned_minutes":40,"state":"ready","prompt":"It's {base year + 10}. Describe our {lens name}.","phone_depth":"Write in the present tense, as if it is already true. One sentence at a time.","segment":"Five Lenses","lands_in":"The 10-year Future","options":{"lens":4,"ai":true},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":5,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":10,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"seeded_from":"seeding","notes":"Set the scene. The seeded sentences appear first, so the room starts with everyone's view. Give 3 to 5 minutes to write, then phones down. Draw out the conversation from the wall and build on the easel. The scribe tags quotes, decisions and tensions and photographs the easel page. Similar sentences lean together into clusters while people write."},
 {"title":"Five Lenses: {lens name}","part":"Day 1","position":9,"mode":"live","interaction":"lens","planned_minutes":40,"state":"ready","prompt":"It's {base year + 10}. What will we know then that we don't know now?","phone_depth":"Write in the present tense, as if it is already true. One sentence at a time.","segment":"Five Lenses","lands_in":"The 10-year Future","options":{"lens":5,"ai":true},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":5,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":10,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"seeded_from":"seeding","notes":"Set the scene, then ask what we will know then that we do not know now. The seeded sentences appear first, so the room starts with everyone's view. Give 3 to 5 minutes to write, then phones down. Draw out the conversation from the wall and build on the easel. The scribe tags quotes, decisions and tensions and photographs the easel page. This is the last lens: the 10-year Future summary comes next."},
 {"title":"Break","part":"Day 1","position":10,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":15,"state":"ready","prompt":"Back in 15 minutes.","phone_depth":"","segment":"Five Lenses","lands_in":"","options":{"screen":"holding"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Nothing live."},
 {"title":"The 10-year Future, by lens","part":"Day 1","position":11,"mode":"live","interaction":"lens_summary","planned_minutes":25,"state":"ready","prompt":"Here is our {base year + 10} Future, one lens at a time. Approve it, or suggest a change.","phone_depth":"Read the summary. Tap Approve, or Suggest a change and say what you would change.","segment":"","lands_in":"The 10-year Future","options":{"lens":1,"ai":true},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":1,"max_characters":140,"max_words":25,"team_led":false,"notes":"About 25 minutes, one lens at a time, straight after the Learning lens. AI drafts each lens in the present tense and every line links to the sentences it came from. You can edit while it is up. Phones tap Approve or Suggest a change, AI folds the suggestions into a new version, and you mark the room's decision for each lens with Mark a decision. Counts never decide. A signed-off summary becomes the draft Map's 10-year Future. The scribe records the reasons for any change."},
 {"title":"Provisional Vision Outcomes","part":"Day 1","position":12,"mode":"live","interaction":"candidates","planned_minutes":65,"state":"ready","prompt":"Which priorities will move us toward our {base year + 10} Future?","phone_depth":"Rename or merge a priority, or suggest a new one. Then spend 100 points.","segment":"","lands_in":"The 3-year Vision","options":{"ai":true,"cut":5},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":6,"max_characters":80,"max_words":10,"team_led":false,"notes":"AI proposes 6 to 10 candidates from all Five Lenses, each with its source sentences. They show only to you until you send them to the TV. Phones rename, merge or suggest, and you accept each with one tap. Then 100 points with a cut line between four and six. Mark provisional records where the room is, and the outcomes stay provisional until Day 2. The scribe keeps the provisional list and who argued what."},
 {"title":"3-year Vision, first pass","part":"Day 1","position":13,"mode":"live","interaction":"bullets","planned_minutes":30,"state":"ready","prompt":"In {base year + 3}, what's true?","phone_depth":"Write what is true, one bullet at a time. Numbers, dates and names help.","segment":"","lands_in":"The 3-year Vision","options":{},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":12,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"notes":"One Vision Outcome at a time. Bullets appear on the TV as people type. An outcome with no bullet stays outlined in Sunrise until it has one, so no outcome leaves the room empty. The scribe listens for numbers, dates and names."},
 {"title":"Close","part":"Day 1","position":14,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":15,"state":"ready","prompt":"Unless Yahweh builds the house, **they labor in vain who build it.**","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The Process","options":{"screen":"scripture","reference":"Psalm 127:1","translation":"World English Bible"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Show the provisional outcomes on the previous screen, then rest on this passage. Invite the team to pray over the outcomes overnight. Phones away. Close Day 1 before you leave the room (it needs a second tap)."},
 {"title":"Prayer and listening","part":"Day 2","position":0,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","day":15,"clock":"08:30","planned_minutes":10,"state":"ready","prompt":"Your ears will hear a word behind you, saying, **“This is the way. Walk in it.”**","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The Process","options":{"screen":"scripture","reference":"Isaiah 30:21","translation":"World English Bible"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Start the day with this passage, then a still screen while the team prays with phones away."},
 {"title":"Listening","part":"Day 2","position":1,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":5,"state":"ready","prompt":"Let's listen.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The Process","options":{"screen":"prayer"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Dark and still. Phones away. Leave a few minutes of quiet."},
 {"title":"What are we sensing?","part":"Day 2","position":2,"mode":"live","interaction":"wall","planned_minutes":15,"state":"ready","prompt":"What are we sensing?","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The Process","options":{},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"notes":"One prompt. Let what the team shares land on the wall, and read a few aloud. The scribe notes what the team shares."},
 {"title":"Confirm the 10-year Future","part":"Day 2","position":3,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":30,"state":"ready","prompt":"Our {base year + 10} Future","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"The 10-year Future","options":{"screen":"holding","outline":"Each signed-off lens, in turn\nWhat has changed overnight?\nSay it out loud"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"A short confirm after prayer. Read each signed-off lens in turn and ask whether anything has changed overnight. The scribe records any change and its reason. This screen is a placeholder until the read-back is built in milestone 5."},
 {"title":"Confirm the Vision Outcomes","part":"Day 2","position":4,"mode":"live","interaction":"confirm","planned_minutes":30,"state":"ready","prompt":"Confirm, rename or challenge each outcome.","phone_depth":"Confirm, rename or challenge each outcome. A reason is optional.","segment":"","lands_in":"The 3-year Vision, Decisions","options":{},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"notes":"The TV shows the counts for confirm, rename and challenge. A challenged outcome lifts to the top of your list and gets a soft highlight on the TV until it is decided. Counts never decide: record the room's consensus decision and its reasons for each outcome. The app warns, and never blocks, if fewer than four or more than six are confirmed. Write a one-line description for each outcome. The scribe records the decision and why."},
 {"title":"Break","part":"Day 2","position":5,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":15,"state":"ready","prompt":"Back in 15 minutes.","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"","options":{"screen":"holding"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Nothing live."},
 {"title":"1-year Outlook","part":"Day 2","position":6,"mode":"live","interaction":"goals","planned_minutes":90,"state":"ready","prompt":"What will we do in {base year + 1} to move each outcome forward?","phone_depth":"Propose a goal with a title, the result, one owner and an end date.","segment":"","lands_in":"The 1-year Outlook, CORE goals","options":{"risk_links":"later"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":6,"max_characters":280,"max_words":50,"team_led":false,"notes":"One Vision Outcome at a time: its 3-year Vision bullets on the left and its 1-year goals on the right. A goal needs a title, a result, one owner and an end date. The pre-mortem comes in the follow-up session, so goals built now do not need a linked risk yet. Each CORE letter shows met or missing, checked in code. Owners come from the attendee list or are added by name and email. The scribe notes decisions, owners and dates."},
 {"title":"Recap","part":"Day 2","position":7,"mode":"live","interaction":"content","planned_minutes":25,"state":"ready","prompt":"Recap","phone_depth":"","segment":"","lands_in":"Clearway Map","options":{"screen":"holding","line":"Our draft Clearway Map"},"settings":{"anonymous":true,"burst_minutes":4,"join_strip":false},"max_sends":3,"max_characters":28,"max_words":3,"team_led":false,"notes":"Open the draft Clearway Map from the live room (Draft Clearway Map) and walk through what is ready. Key issues wait for the pre-mortem in the follow-up session, and commander's intent comes then too. Print or save it as a PDF for the team. It is for your control surface and printing, not the TV."},
